Z||000005||TRiAD||10-30-2001||10:40 AM||||1) Neither will ever see the inside of a showroom, or more importantly, a garage. <P>2) As someone who's driven ONLY FWD for the last uh, nevermind how long, I can say, count me out as well. FWD can be "fun", but I'm dying for some rear-wheel drifts!<P>Can't wait to get my Fiero this weekend! Bring it on!<BR><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAlAL0S2vLvViYU9P7uloj72fLFTqfz59trng8I7AOG7hGCvfk6WP96n!gnOaEUAvooy1kUoWucv7BJ7L5EWg/temp-sig.gif">    <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
